;
; How Threshold files a seat it lists, in MYRA: its place in the roster,
; its role (1 owner, 2 person, 3 guest), its lock (0 none, 1 passphrase,
; 2 passkey), its accent colour and the milliseconds before a login try is
; heard again. Never a hash, a salt or a passphrase: there is no field for
; one.
^ZXSEAT(seat:i4) = role:i1! ^ lock:i1! ^ color:i10! ^ wait:i7!
